{"id":"8124547465290","handle":"side-slit-chiffon-sleeveless-bridesmaid-dress-es02704","title":"Side Slit Chiffon Sleeveless Bridesmaid Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>This one-shoulder bridesmaid maxi is made for a confident, camera-ready look without feeling restricted. The softly draped neckline frames the shoulders and keeps the top looking smooth, while the A-line skirt falls from the waist to skim over hips and thighs—ideal if you want a flattering fit that isn’t clingy. A side slit adds comfort for the aisle and the dance floor, and the clean, minimal shape makes it easy to match different accessories so your bridal party looks coordinated, not identical.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: Floor-length.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Short sleeves.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Back zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: It is not padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises chiffon.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is non-stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Bridesmaid Dresses","tags":["A-Line","Apple","Asymmetrical","Bridesmaid Dresses","Chiffon Dresses","Dresses","Fall","Floor-Length","Gathered","Hourglass","Inverted","measure","One Shoulder Dresses","Pear","Rectangular","Rhinestone Embellished","Ruffled","Short Sleeves","Sleeveless","Spring","Summer","Thigh-High Slit","Winter","With Sleeves"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.ever-pretty.com/products/side-slit-chiffon-sleeveless-bridesmaid-dress-es02704","capturedAt":"2026-09-30T00:40:21.909Z","price":{"amount":69.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"options":["Color","Size"],"variants":[{"id":"43302207488074","sku":"ES02704BD04","color":"Burgundy","size":"4","options":["Burgundy","4"],"price":{"amount":69.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"image":"https://aj-nb.github.io/ever-pretty-media-1/media/optimized/7e51fd22a4a8b